{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"Plan remediation evidence: local Git 2.55 probe produced 'packet: fetch> filter blob:none' for plain fetch inheritance and 'packet: clone> filter blob:none' for clone. The revised oracle matches packet direction/content without hard-coding the actor label. git daemon -h on Git 2.55 has no --git-config option, so the fixture now uses a temporary GIT_CONFIG_GLOBAL plus GIT_CONFIG_NOSYSTEM=1 inherited by daemon/upload-pack; it explicitly forbids repository-local allowFilter. Size-guard tests now have non-overlapping names and execute the real workflow blocks against exact-threshold full/blobless repositories."},"env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1785612516389964001,"uuid":"46b675ac-35e0-4b49-9a3c-5ec686d24bcd"}